THE EASIEST WAY TO REMEMBER

Nominal = Category only

Ordinal = Category + Order

Interval = Order + Equal Intervals

Ratio = Order + Equal Intervals + True Zero

In short:

Nominal → Category

Ordinal → Category + Order

Interval → Order + Equal Intervals

Ratio → Order + Equal Intervals + True Zero
